1
00:00:03,030 --> 00:00:06,300
Fresh steamed buns, piping hot!

2
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:08,170
Two, please. Coming right up.

3
00:00:08,170 --> 00:00:10,000
Here you are.

4
00:00:12,830 --> 00:00:14,430
Why are there so many imperial guards on
the street?

5
00:00:14,430 --> 00:00:15,400
You haven't heard?

6
00:00:15,530 --> 00:00:17,600
The Weisu delegation enters the capital
today.

7
00:00:17,630 --> 00:00:19,230
The number of patrols in the city

8
00:00:19,230 --> 00:00:20,570
has doubled these past two days.

9
00:00:20,570 --> 00:00:21,370
Weisu?

10
00:00:23,330 --> 00:00:24,730
They've been quiet for over ten years.

11
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:28,530
I heard the Noble Consort wanted to see
her family.

12
00:00:28,770 --> 00:00:30,930
The visit was arranged long ago.

13
00:00:31,170 --> 00:00:31,870
Who knew...

14
00:00:31,870 --> 00:00:33,270
The delegation is here!

15
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:34,530
The delegation is here!

16
00:00:34,570 --> 00:00:35,730
They've already reached the city gate.

17
00:00:35,730 --> 00:00:37,100
They're here! Come on!

18
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:38,670
Let's go have a look!

19
00:00:47,430 --> 00:00:48,500
So these are the Weisu people.

20
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:49,570
They're so tall.

21
00:00:49,570 --> 00:00:50,670
Aside from being taller and stronger,

22
00:00:50,900 --> 00:00:52,930
Otherwise, they look much like us.

23
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:54,200
Just a bunch of barbarians.

24
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:55,200
What's there to see?

25
00:00:55,230 --> 00:00:57,430
If Dingyuan hadn't led the Yulin cavalry

26
00:00:57,430 --> 00:00:58,800
north and broken through Weisu,

27
00:00:58,800 --> 00:01:00,130
those barbarians would still be making
trouble.

28
00:01:00,900 --> 00:01:03,030
Under the emperor's nose? Do you want to
die?

29
00:01:03,030 --> 00:01:04,330
Look!

30
00:01:04,530 --> 00:01:06,330
Who's that leading them on horseback?

31
00:01:06,330 --> 00:01:07,830
He's quite handsome.

32
00:01:08,300 --> 00:01:10,370
I heard they have a general named Helian
Zhao.

33
00:01:10,900 --> 00:01:11,830
A young hero.

34
00:01:12,330 --> 00:01:14,430
He's won many battles for Weisu these past
two years.

35
00:01:14,530 --> 00:01:15,430
Could that be him?

36
00:01:16,230 --> 00:01:17,970
General, word has come from the palace.

37
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:19,000
The delegation will enter the palace
today.

38
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:19,800
They will rest first.

39
00:01:19,800 --> 00:01:21,300
Tomorrow at dusk, the palace will host a
banquet.

40
00:01:21,630 --> 00:01:23,030
All right. I understand.

41
00:01:23,300 --> 00:01:24,100
Move on.

42
00:01:27,630 --> 00:01:28,530
Outrageous.

43
00:01:28,770 --> 00:01:30,770
The streets are crawling with imperial
guards today.

44
00:01:31,570 --> 00:01:34,630
With the Noble Consort backing them,

45
00:01:34,700 --> 00:01:36,530
so they strut about Great Chu with such
fanfare.

46
00:01:37,229 --> 00:01:38,100
Enough.

47
00:01:38,470 --> 00:01:41,700
For now, we must summon Prince Yu back
soon.

48
00:01:42,170 --> 00:01:43,729
I'll have someone see to it.

49
00:01:52,170 --> 00:01:52,970
How dare you!

50
00:01:54,170 --> 00:01:55,030
This place is...

51
00:01:55,030 --> 00:01:57,170
This is where rebels gather to plot
treason.

52
00:01:58,900 --> 00:01:59,700
Chief.

53
00:02:01,430 --> 00:02:03,330
Take these three rebels back.

54
00:02:03,530 --> 00:02:04,370
Yes.

55
00:02:04,870 --> 00:02:05,900
What rebels?

56
00:02:05,970 --> 00:02:06,800
Let go!

57
00:02:07,300 --> 00:02:08,130
Chu Mingke!

58
00:02:08,330 --> 00:02:09,430
On what grounds are you arresting us?

59
00:02:09,430 --> 00:02:11,100
On the grounds that His Majesty granted me

60
00:02:11,100 --> 00:02:12,930
the right to execute first and report
later.

61
00:02:12,930 --> 00:02:15,500
Bah! A dog borrowing its master's power.

62
00:02:15,500 --> 00:02:17,170
Nothing but a castrated cur.

63
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:21,300
For every insult, I slap you once.

64
00:02:21,300 --> 00:02:23,200
Chu Mingke, how dare you!

65
00:02:23,200 --> 00:02:24,800
Lord Chen is a servant of Great Chu.

66
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:25,930
How dare you strike him?

67
00:02:26,030 --> 00:02:28,000
Bah! Eunuch dog!

68
00:02:30,230 --> 00:02:31,130
Insult me again.

69
00:02:31,829 --> 00:02:34,700
Eunuch dogs are ruining the state. I swear
I will...

70
00:02:38,630 --> 00:02:39,430
Take him away.

71
00:02:40,130 --> 00:02:42,170
His Majesty will not let you get away with
this!

72
00:02:42,230 --> 00:02:44,630
The eunuch faction is ruining the state!

73
00:02:45,370 --> 00:02:46,770
The eunuch faction is ruining the state!

74
00:02:49,170 --> 00:02:49,970
Your Excellency.

75
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:54,230
Your Excellency.

76
00:02:56,300 --> 00:02:58,000
My lord, you honor me too much.

77
00:02:58,030 --> 00:02:59,430
The delegation enters the capital today.

78
00:03:00,370 --> 00:03:02,200
May I ask, Your Excellency,

79
00:03:02,730 --> 00:03:04,570
why you are here?

80
00:03:05,300 --> 00:03:07,230
There is something I cannot understand
either.

81
00:03:07,570 --> 00:03:09,930
The city is filled with imperial guards
today.

82
00:03:10,430 --> 00:03:12,970
How could rebels be plotting here?

83
00:03:13,900 --> 00:03:16,300
I do not care why these three gathered
here.

84
00:03:16,300 --> 00:03:18,700
But if you dare make trouble under my nose
again,

85
00:03:18,930 --> 00:03:20,230
I will cut off your head

86
00:03:20,230 --> 00:03:22,800
and hang it before Lingji Palace as a
lantern.

87
00:03:23,829 --> 00:03:24,630
Move.

88
00:03:27,530 --> 00:03:28,730
Farewell, Your Excellency.

89
00:03:53,500 --> 00:03:54,970
Who came with the delegation?

90
00:03:55,329 --> 00:03:57,030
Mostly tribal nobles.

91
00:03:57,370 --> 00:03:59,770
And a young general named Helian Zhao.

92
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:03,800
Central Plains wine has no kick.

93
00:04:03,830 --> 00:04:05,130
It goes down soft and limp.

94
00:04:05,330 --> 00:04:06,500
The land and water are different.

95
00:04:07,100 --> 00:04:08,600
So customs and food are different too.

96
00:04:14,770 --> 00:04:16,230
If you want something strong and pure,

97
00:04:17,130 --> 00:04:18,899
the grasslands will have plenty when you
return.

98
00:04:20,070 --> 00:04:21,300
This Shunjing...

99
00:04:21,300 --> 00:04:22,730
From flowers to people,

100
00:04:22,730 --> 00:04:24,400
everything is delicate as paper.

101
00:04:24,700 --> 00:04:25,970
If this were Weisu,

102
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:27,700
one gust of wind would knock them over.

103
00:04:29,030 --> 00:04:29,930
Indeed.

104
00:04:30,400 --> 00:04:34,130
Shunjing's winter plums can't bear prairie
winds.

105
00:04:34,830 --> 00:04:36,830
Your Excellency, please hurry over.

106
00:04:36,830 --> 00:04:38,630
His Majesty is still waiting for you
inside.

107
00:04:40,100 --> 00:04:40,900
Understood.

108
00:04:50,530 --> 00:04:52,300
Your Majesty, I'm late.

109
00:04:52,300 --> 00:04:54,330
It seems Fengtian Hall is far too large.

110
00:04:54,330 --> 00:04:56,700
You lost your way just walking through it.

111
00:05:07,270 --> 00:05:08,330
Mingke.

112
00:05:08,700 --> 00:05:09,770
Yes.

113
00:05:16,900 --> 00:05:18,300
My lord, you are...

114
00:05:22,970 --> 00:05:24,570
You are quite unreasonable, my lord.

115
00:05:25,100 --> 00:05:26,530
Attacking without a word.

116
00:05:33,700 --> 00:05:34,900
Your strikes are merciless, my lord.

117
00:05:34,900 --> 00:05:36,170
What a waste of those tender eyes.

118
00:05:36,170 --> 00:05:37,370
Too much chatter.

119
00:05:52,130 --> 00:05:53,100
My lord,

120
00:05:53,170 --> 00:05:55,170
you smell of blood.

121
00:06:09,630 --> 00:06:10,570
You are about to lose.

122
00:06:10,800 --> 00:06:12,500
Why not say something sweet?

123
00:06:12,630 --> 00:06:13,730
Then I might go easy on you.

124
00:06:13,730 --> 00:06:15,530
Have you ever heard the saying,

125
00:06:15,800 --> 00:06:17,530
Pride comes before defeat?

126
00:06:29,370 --> 00:06:31,230
I don't need anyone to go easy on me to
win.

127
00:06:31,230 --> 00:06:33,100
You lost.

128
00:06:51,630 --> 00:06:54,300
Your subject, Chu Mingke, kneels before
Your Majesty.

129
00:06:57,300 --> 00:06:58,270
The arrowhead is sharp.

130
00:06:58,470 --> 00:07:00,030
It may wound Your Majesty.

131
00:07:00,030 --> 00:07:02,300
Let me remove it.

132
00:07:22,570 --> 00:07:23,470
You may leave.

133
00:07:23,470 --> 00:07:24,270
Yes.

134
00:07:25,600 --> 00:07:26,870
Rise.

135
00:07:28,400 --> 00:07:29,770
You were right.

136
00:07:31,270 --> 00:07:33,070
This blade is indeed sharp.

137
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:36,400
Hold this.

138
00:07:39,730 --> 00:07:41,500
Your Majesty, it is time for your elixir.

139
00:07:49,330 --> 00:07:52,430
A report from Shanxi says Duan Yunping is
gravely ill.

140
00:07:52,700 --> 00:07:54,400
His time is near.

141
00:07:54,970 --> 00:07:57,200
General Duan has governed Shanxi for
decades.

142
00:07:57,800 --> 00:07:58,830
He is a true hero.

143
00:08:03,370 --> 00:08:06,270
Even the greatest heroes grow old.

144
00:08:06,930 --> 00:08:08,430
As for Helian Zhao...

145
00:08:09,300 --> 00:08:10,870
He rose to fame at a young age.

146
00:08:12,430 --> 00:08:14,170
His edge is too exposed.

147
00:08:14,300 --> 00:08:15,970
He is barely nineteen now.

148
00:08:16,300 --> 00:08:17,770
He is indeed a born commander.

149
00:08:18,930 --> 00:08:20,400
Indeed.

150
00:08:20,770 --> 00:08:23,270
A pity he was born in Weisu.

151
00:08:24,300 --> 00:08:25,600
Those not of our kind

152
00:08:25,600 --> 00:08:26,670
are bound to have different hearts.

153
00:08:32,799 --> 00:08:33,870
Enough.

154
00:08:33,870 --> 00:08:35,700
These are troubled times.

155
00:08:37,030 --> 00:08:39,929
Use your own judgment in all things.

156
00:08:40,900 --> 00:08:41,700
Yes.

157
00:09:03,900 --> 00:09:05,570
Your Excellency, my lord!

158
00:09:05,570 --> 00:09:06,430
You've finally come!

159
00:09:06,430 --> 00:09:07,530
Your Excellency!

160
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:09,600
Please go see Her Highness at once!

161
00:09:09,800 --> 00:09:10,730
What happened to Her Highness?

162
00:09:10,830 --> 00:09:11,830
I don't know.

163
00:09:12,070 --> 00:09:14,500
She has raged since returning from the
banquet.

164
00:09:15,400 --> 00:09:16,600
No one can talk her down.

165
00:09:16,900 --> 00:09:18,270
She has smashed many things.

166
00:09:18,530 --> 00:09:19,330
Get out!

167
00:09:21,500 --> 00:09:23,930
All you ungrateful wretches, get out!

168
00:09:27,500 --> 00:09:29,300
Your Highness!

169
00:09:29,300 --> 00:09:30,330
Please calm down, Your Highness.

170
00:09:30,330 --> 00:09:31,400
Please calm down, Your Highness.

171
00:09:33,070 --> 00:09:34,300
If Your Highness is angry,

172
00:09:34,470 --> 00:09:35,930
beat me to death if you must.

173
00:09:36,870 --> 00:09:38,200
Just do not harm your own body.

174
00:09:38,800 --> 00:09:40,500
Your jade hands are soft and beautiful.

175
00:09:40,730 --> 00:09:43,300
What if you hurt them?

176
00:09:43,300 --> 00:09:44,170
Does it hurt?

177
00:09:44,170 --> 00:09:45,330
No.

178
00:09:45,330 --> 00:09:46,800
Please don't be angry anymore, Your
Highness.

179
00:09:49,330 --> 00:09:51,230
Get down there and kneel properly.

180
00:09:51,800 --> 00:09:54,030
Who told you to beat him?

181
00:09:54,670 --> 00:09:56,330
You disobeyed me.

182
00:09:57,130 --> 00:09:58,600
You always win.

183
00:09:59,230 --> 00:10:02,400
You Central Plains people always win.

184
00:10:02,630 --> 00:10:04,200
Isn't that enough?

185
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:05,870
You've grown up.

186
00:10:05,870 --> 00:10:06,470
Your wings have hardened.

187
00:10:06,970 --> 00:10:07,800
Now you want to fly off on your own.

188
00:10:07,800 --> 00:10:09,770
Is that it? Insolent thing!

189
00:10:09,930 --> 00:10:12,100
Have you forgotten what you once promised
me?

190
00:10:13,300 --> 00:10:15,030
Mingke...

191
00:10:15,330 --> 00:10:16,830
Do not blame me.

192
00:10:16,900 --> 00:10:18,770
Your Highness, I haven't forgotten.

193
00:10:18,930 --> 00:10:20,270
I will never forget.

194
00:10:23,470 --> 00:10:24,370
It was my fault.

195
00:10:24,370 --> 00:10:26,300
Please do not make yourself ill with
anger.

196
00:10:30,370 --> 00:10:32,570
In this palace, you are the only one who
cares for me.

197
00:10:32,970 --> 00:10:35,170
Everyone else only upsets me.

198
00:10:36,230 --> 00:10:37,730
Who has upset Your Highness?

199
00:10:38,570 --> 00:10:39,970
Consort Chen, of course.

200
00:10:40,330 --> 00:10:43,130
Consort Chen found some tramp to seduce
His Majesty.

201
00:10:43,630 --> 00:10:45,730
The pregnant palace maid in the plum
garden.

202
00:10:46,130 --> 00:10:47,930
Go. Kill her.

203
00:10:48,400 --> 00:10:48,930
Yes.

204
00:11:12,600 --> 00:11:15,030
Doing wicked deeds this late, my lord...

205
00:11:15,430 --> 00:11:17,870
aren't you afraid wronged ghosts will come
for you?

206
00:11:23,570 --> 00:11:24,800
A wronged ghost?

207
00:11:26,170 --> 00:11:28,570
Better that than a mangy cur who will not
let go.

208
00:11:32,230 --> 00:11:34,570
So you actually remember me, my lord.

209
00:11:34,930 --> 00:11:36,770
I thought you were a heartless man

210
00:11:36,830 --> 00:11:39,170
and had long forgotten me.

211
00:11:41,200 --> 00:11:43,400
Could it be that you miss me

212
00:11:44,200 --> 00:11:45,470
as fiercely as I miss you?

213
00:11:46,530 --> 00:11:47,930
I miss the day you die.

214
00:11:50,970 --> 00:11:52,630
Then you can only keep longing for it.

215
00:11:53,470 --> 00:11:54,930
I am an honored guest of the delegation.

216
00:11:55,470 --> 00:11:57,670
If I also become a drowned corpse in the
pond,

217
00:11:58,200 --> 00:12:00,430
how would your country explain it?

218
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:03,800
My lord.

219
00:12:04,570 --> 00:12:05,770
You cannot kill me.

220
00:12:07,870 --> 00:12:10,370
Do you know what living worse than death
means?

221
00:12:16,070 --> 00:12:17,670
Such strength, my lord.

222
00:12:17,730 --> 00:12:19,030
So passionate the moment we meet.

223
00:12:19,300 --> 00:12:20,670
I am almost flattered.

224
00:12:21,330 --> 00:12:22,870
So cold to me?

225
00:12:22,900 --> 00:12:24,670
After all, I fell for you at first sight,

226
00:12:24,670 --> 00:12:25,700
and fell deeper at second sight.

227
00:12:46,930 --> 00:12:47,330
Move.

228
00:12:48,500 --> 00:12:49,300
Who's there?
